message: "If you use this software or its validation results, please cite it as below."
title: "interstellar: relativistic spaceflight simulator with a reproducible validation suite"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Podlevskikh
    given-names: Vladimir
repository-code: "https://github.com/namebogsecret/interstellar"
url: "https://space.podlevskikh.com"
abstract: "Browser simulator of relativistic spaceflight (specific-momentum integrator, proper time, Doppler, weak-field gravitational time dilation) together with a one-command validation suite against analytic references: hyperbolic motion, the twin paradox, relativistic Doppler and gravitational redshift."
keywords:
  - special relativity
  - hyperbolic motion
  - twin paradox
  - redshift
  - validation
